!Issue Tracking: <a href="https://github.com/Dash-Industry-Forum/IOPv5/issues?q=is%3Aopen+project%3ADash-Industry-Forum%2F27" target="_blank">Currently open Part 1 issues</a><br><a href="https://github.com/Dash-Industry-Forum/IOPv5/issues/new?title=%5BPart+1%5D%3A+" target="_blank">File a new Part 1 issue</a> (then assign to <a href="https://github.com/orgs/Dash-Industry-Forum/projects/27" target="_blank">Part 1 project</a>)
